## Interface: 11509, 20506, 16001, 120105
## Title: ZacUI |cff33ff99Bars|r
## Notes: ZacUI action bars and bar loadouts. Replaces Bartender4 and Myslot.
## Author: Zac
## Version: 3.0.2
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZacUI\Media\addonIcon
## X-Category: Interface Enhancements
## Dependencies: Zacui
## OptionalDeps: Bartender4, Myslot
## X-ZacUI-Part: Bars

# Part of ZacUI. These files were lifted out of the main addon so this
# piece can be switched off in the AddOns list on its own. They share
# ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by Core_Boot) and its saved
# variables; every setting still lives in ZacUIDB and in profiles.
# Load order within this file is the same as it was inside ZacUI.

AB_Core.lua
AB_ActionBars.lua
AB_Extras.lua
# Keybind mode (/zui kb) and the note about keys on buttons nobody can see
# (2026-11-07). After AB_Extras: it reads the pet and stance buttons.
AB_Keys.lua
AB_Import.lua
AB_Loadouts.lua
# Feature cluster 3 (2026-11-07): a new spell rank put on the bars when it is
# learned, off by default. After AB_Import (it rides the bars module's start).
AB_Uprank.lua
AB_Preview.lua
Config_PagesBars.lua
# Drag to customise in the bar preview (ZacUI's UIF_PreviewDrag).
AB_PreviewDrag.lua
